<title>USA: Fla. $55 mln deal won by Goldman at 5.3111 pct TIC.</title>
<headline>Fla. $55 mln deal won by Goldman at 5.3111 pct TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said Wednesday it won $55.4 million Florida Department of Transportation bonds, issued for Alligator Alley, at a true interest cost of 5.3111 percent.</p>
</text>
